    title: "Real Estate vs Mutual Funds in India: Which Gives Better Returns?",
    excerpt:
      "A data-driven comparison of real estate and mutual fund investments in India — returns, liquidity, tax treatment, risks and which option suits different financial goals.",
    category: "Investing",
