    slug: "personal-loan-vs-credit-card",
    title: "Personal Loan vs Credit Card EMI: Which is Cheaper? A Complete Comparison",
    excerpt:
      "A detailed comparison of personal loans and credit card EMI options in India — interest rates, processing fees, credit score impact, flexibility and when to use each.",
    category: "Credit",
